# https://knowhowspot.blog/lammps-perfect-crystal-guide

# initialization
units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

# defining face-centered cubic lattice with a lattice constant of Al.
# lattice constant - physical distance between unit cells in a crystal lattice,
# which defines the size of unit cell.
lattice fcc 4.05

# creating the simulation box
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

# some settings
mass 1 26.981539 # Al mass
pair_style eam # embedded alloy method
pair_coeff * * Al_jnp.eam

# minimizing energy
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 20 delay 0 check no
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 1000 10000

# save system after energy minimization
write_data min.data
